; Three pieces of ground, drawn once, with the shots taken on them held nowhere
; near here.
;
; Not one of these nodes says what the ground does. A region is four corners,
; four edges and a loop; how the ground falls across it is derived from the shots
; inside it every time somebody asks, and is written into no file a walk would
; read (docs/decisions/0009-derived-values-are-never-written-back.md).
;
; The three exist to put the derivation in three situations:
;
;   S-terrace  enough shots, in two frames, with a mark shot twice
;   S-strip    two shots, which is not enough to bound any area
;   S-ridge    four shots on one line, which bound none either
;
; Each links the file its own shots were written in, which is the stored half of
; the relationship: somebody decided that evidence backs that ground. Which
; shots fall inside which region is the derived half, and is stored nowhere.

